{
  "$comment": "Informative example for RFC-MACP-0006 §4 (HTTP binding): Send. Every per-envelope decision is a 200 with the Ack in the body (§4.4); only a body that is not a SendRequest is a request-level error (§4.5). make json-validate validates every `envelope` object in this file against macp-envelope.schema.json, and every error body against macp-http-error.schema.json.",
